        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVCHM, Fifth Avenue Plate With Crystal Chambord Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nGlorified with over a century of history, the Fifth Avenue style is found in many of America's finest homes, offices and public buildings. Marked by a clean, crisp look, its unpretentious, tailored style reinforces an expression of self-assurance. The Fifth Avenue Plate's simple lines combined with the Crystal Chambord Knob's classic style, draw attention to the stoutness created by its designers. This clean, classic design is a favorite in decorative door hardware. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-fifth-avenue-series\"><b>Fifth Avenue Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur FAVCHM Fifth Avenue Plate With Crystal Chambord Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Fifth Avenue Rose is made out of solid forged brass and the Chambord Knob is 24% lead crystal.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fifth Avenue Chambord Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Plate Height: 7.17\"</li>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Plate Width: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Chambord Knob Diameter: 2.11\"</li>\r\n<li>Chambord Knob Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-FAVCHM-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262180\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur FAVCHM Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Fifth Avenue Chambord Knob",
                "description": "Grandeur FAVCHM, Fifth Avenue Plate With Crystal Chambord Knob - Glorified by over a century of history, the Fifth Avenue style is found in many of America's finest homes, offices and public buildings. Marked by a clean, crisp look, its unpretentious, tailored style reinforces an expression of self-assurance. The Fifth Avenue Plate's simple lines combined with the Crystal Chambord Knob's classic style, draw attention to the stoutness created by its designers. This clean, classic design is a favorite in decorative door hardware. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
                "keywords": "Fifth Avenue Plate With Crystal Chambord Knobs, Fifth Avenue Chambord Knobs, GRA-FAVCHM, Grandeur FAVCHM, glass knobs, crystal knobs, Chambord Knob with Fifth Avenue rosettes, classic knobs, ornate knobs, victorian knobs,  Grandeur fifth avenue series,"
